  "body": "### What is the issue with the Cookie Store API Standard?\n\nCurrently, the spec says 4.2.2.2: [Normalize](https://cookiestore.spec.whatwg.org/#normalize-a-cookie-name-or-value) name.\n\nThis means that I could call: `CookieStoreManager.subscribe({ name: '===='});`. Instead, the validation of the name should follow the https://cookiestore.spec.whatwg.org/#set-a-cookie steps and reject '=', C0 control, etc.",
